    "detailed_description": "&quot;Mudoba&quot; is an atmospheric survival horror in a parallel dimension with one procedurally generated location.<br>You a research scientist who accidentally got into the &quot;Theta&quot; dimension.<br>You have the opportunity to learn about what exactly happened in this dimension, reveal its secrets and find a way out.<br>This dimension is very old and it is living its last days.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179270/extras/719547c5bda768fd2b54f133fb79a798.poster.avif?t=1722384092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179270/extras/719547c5bda768fd2b54f133fb79a798.webm?t=1722384092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2179270/extras/719547c5bda768fd2b54f133fb79a798.mp4?t=1722384092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A gas mask, flashlight, medkits and map will help you in this:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A gas mask will help you survive in a toxic fog, look for filters for it.<br></li><li> The flashlight will allow you to see the darkest corners of the houses, but it needs batteries to work.<br></li><li> Medkits will help to heal your wounds quickly.<br></li><li> Fragments of the map will allow you to quickly navigate the area and find a way out.<br></li><li> Notes, pages of the book &quot;Tachyonics&quot; and secret protocols contain all the necessary information about this dimension.</li></ul><br>Beware of water and what lives in it.<br>Find a way out of the marsh.<br><br>The game contains:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An adventure in the middle of a strange swamp<br></li><li> Nice graphics<br></li><li> Gloomy atmosphere<br></li><li> The plot is hidden in notes and secret protocols<br></li><li> English and Ukrainian localization<br></li><li> One procedurally generated location</li></ul>",
